WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Overview column width

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:07.000
Before: entire actual desktop recording; opening, closing and right-panel mutual exclusion retain the measured 268-pixel overview column.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.600
After: entire actual desktop recording; opening, closing and right-panel mutual exclusion retain the measured 268-pixel overview column.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.100
Before: entire actual responsive recording; desktop, narrow, threshold and phone states are preserved. Known phone issue #16792 remains separate from passing geometry checks.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.600
After: entire actual responsive recording; desktop, narrow, threshold and phone states are preserved. Known phone issue #16792 remains separate from passing geometry checks.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Before: matched full context in Light+; inner and outer columns measure 268 pixels and the visible card measures 240 pixels.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.600
After: matched full context in Light+; inner and outer columns measure 268 pixels and the visible card measures 240 pixels.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.600
Before: actual overview detail; the column stays 268 pixels and the card stays 240 pixels. The patch moves the inner width declaration to CSS.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.600
After: actual overview detail; the column stays 268 pixels and the card stays 240 pixels. The patch moves the inner width declaration to CSS.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.400
Before: known issue #16792 remains: toggle pressed on, overview card absent. This is a reproduced limitation, not a passing phone result or a fix.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.200
After: known issue #16792 remains: toggle pressed on, overview card absent. This is a reproduced limitation, not a passing phone result or a fix.
